why: every lane in this line bought its answer's SHAPE by persuasion
  — a rendered example, written rules, a field order found by
  measuring the residue. OpenAI-compatible gateways take
  response_format with a JSON schema, and JsonSchema.of(Schema[I]) is
  exactly that document; the rozum gateway honours it (probed: a
  json_schema request answered valid JSON). Whether the contract
  makes the persuasion unnecessary is a measurement, not a hunch.

what: OpenAi.request gains responseFormat (defaulted) and
  OpenAi.jsonSchema(name, schema, strict); TestStructuredOutput
  (Live): four arms over the 120 messages on the Meeting taxonomy —
  the shipped prompt with examples (persuasion only), the same plus
  the contract, a one-sentence prompt under the contract, and that
  plus the examples — macro F1 over decoded, undecodable/empty/error
  counts, prompt and reply length per message, seconds per message.
  A default moves only on a gain that clears the fixture's bar; a
  gateway that refuses the schema's shape is counted, not hidden.
